{"seq":3,"slug":"near-expiry-markdown-clearance-disposal","title":"近效期降价促销、清库策略与过期报废处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/lot-batch-expiry-fefo-traceability-management/shelf-life-monitoring-alert/near-expiry-markdown-clearance-disposal","wordCount":2832,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"近效期降价促销-清库策略与过期报废处置\">近效期降价促销、清库策略与过期报废处置</h1><p>预警引擎把一批还剩 21 天到期的希腊酸奶标红、指派给品类经理——但标红本身不解决任何事。这批货只有三条出路：打折卖、换渠道卖、或报废承担损耗。走哪条取决于一个冷冰冰的比较：<strong>现在卖能收回多少</strong>，对比<strong>拖到过期只能报废或捐赠能收回多少</strong>。本文接住<a href=\"remaining-shelf-life-metric-threshold\">剩余保质期度量与预警阈值模型</a>和<a href=\"expiry-alert-engine-escalation-workflow\">效期预警引擎、分级升级与处置工作流</a>留下的尾巴——预警触发后，价格、渠道、销毁、账务这四件事怎么落地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>临期处置的本质是一个<strong>随时间衰减的收益最大化问题</strong>。设批次在手量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>、单位可变成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>、当前剩余保质期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RSL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RSL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RSL</span></span></span></span></span></span>，若维持原价单位周期去化速率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，打折到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 后升为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。要判断&quot;现在就降价&quot;还是&quot;再等几天&quot;，比较两条路径的期望回款：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>now</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{now}} = p \\cdot Q \\cdot \\eta(p) + s \\cdot Q \\cdot (1-\\eta(p)) - k \\cdot Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">now</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是折扣价下的售罄概率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 是残值（员工内购价、清货商收购价或捐赠的税抵现值），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是单位报废处置成本（销毁费、冷链处理费）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>now</mtext></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{now}} &lt; s \\cdot Q - k \\cdot Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">now</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>，说明连打折都卖不动，应直接走捐赠或处置。折扣的<strong>时机</strong>比<strong>幅度</strong>更值钱：同一批货打 5 折在第 30 天做，回收率通常显著高于第 5 天做——过早降价牺牲的是本可以原价卖掉的销量。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[预警触发的近效期批次&lt;br/&gt;含 Q / c / RSL / 渠道约束] --&gt; B{是否可继续在该渠道销售?&lt;br/&gt;RSL &gt;= 渠道 MRSL}&#10;  B -- 否 --&gt; C[降级渠道&lt;br/&gt;折扣店 / 清货商 / 员工内购 / 捐赠]&#10;  B -- 是 --&gt; D[计算最优折扣档位&lt;br/&gt;argmax V_now]&#10;  D --&gt; E{预测清空时间 T_sell &lt;= RSL?}&#10;  E -- 是 --&gt; F[执行折扣 + 监控去化速率&lt;br/&gt;未达标则降档]&#10;  E -- 否 --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt; G{仍有残值?}&#10;  G -- 是 --&gt; H[清货/捐赠&lt;br/&gt;收回报或税抵]&#10;  G -- 否 --&gt; I[报废核销&lt;br/&gt;隔离区 / 销毁 / 留痕]&#10;  F --&gt; J[批次售罄&lt;br/&gt;关闭预警]&#10;  H --&gt; J&#10;  I --&gt; K[账务: 计提与减记&lt;br/&gt;损耗归属复盘]\">flowchart TD\n  A[预警触发的近效期批次&lt;br/&gt;含 Q / c / RSL / 渠道约束] --&gt; B{是否可继续在该渠道销售?&lt;br/&gt;RSL &gt;= 渠道 MRSL}\n  B -- 否 --&gt; C[降级渠道&lt;br/&gt;折扣店 / 清货商 / 员工内购 / 捐赠]\n  B -- 是 --&gt; D[计算最优折扣档位&lt;br/&gt;argmax V_now]\n  D --&gt; E{预测清空时间 T_sell &lt;= RSL?}\n  E -- 是 --&gt; F[执行折扣 + 监控去化速率&lt;br/&gt;未达标则降档]\n  E -- 否 --&gt; C\n  C --&gt; G{仍有残值?}\n  G -- 是 --&gt; H[清货/捐赠&lt;br/&gt;收回报或税抵]\n  G -- 否 --&gt; I[报废核销&lt;br/&gt;隔离区 / 销毁 / 留痕]\n  F --&gt; J[批次售罄&lt;br/&gt;关闭预警]\n  H --&gt; J\n  I --&gt; K[账务: 计提与减记&lt;br/&gt;损耗归属复盘]</pre><p>处置路径与&quot;打折就能解决&quot;的直觉差别很大，每种处置的<strong>速度、回收率与合规成本</strong>都不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处置路径</th>\n<th>回收率区间</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>合规负担</th>\n<th>适用条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原渠道阶梯降价</td>\n<td>40%–70%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低（需标价合规）</td>\n<td>RSL 仍满足渠道 MRSL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>折扣/临期专区</td>\n<td>20%–45%</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>门店有临期专区或线上专区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清货商整批收购</td>\n<td>10%–30%</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>中（需交易凭证）</td>\n<td>大批量、整批打包</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>员工内购</td>\n<td>15%–35%</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中（税务/福利口径）</td>\n<td>品类允许、有政策</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>捐赠</td>\n<td>0% 现金 + 税抵/ESG</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>高（食品安全链）</td>\n<td>未过期、可追溯、受捐方接收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退供/退货</td>\n<td>视合同</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>高（供应商谈判）</td>\n<td>合同含退货条款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>报废销毁</td>\n<td>−5%–0%</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>高（环保/监管留痕）</td>\n<td>已过期或不合格</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"阶梯降价与动态折扣定价\">阶梯降价与动态折扣定价</h2><p>降价不是一次性拍脑袋决定折扣率，而是<strong>一组预定义的档位（markdown ladder）加上触发时点</strong>。零售业最经典的规则是按剩余保质期比例分级：例如&quot;剩余 ≤ 2/3 走 9 折、≤ 1/3 走 7 折、≤ 1/10 走 5 折&quot;。好处是<strong>可执行、可审计、门店无需判断</strong>；坏处是对销量不敏感——畅销品可能在 7 折前就卖光，滞销品打到 5 折还是压手。</p>\n<p>更精细的做法是<strong>动态降价（dynamic markdown）</strong>：把折扣率当作时间的函数持续求解。设价格弹性为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>，需求近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(p) = v_0 \\,(p/p_0)^{-\\epsilon}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0213em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，代入清空条件 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>sell</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mtext>RSL</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{sell}} = Q / v(p) \\le \\text{RSL}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sell</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RSL</span></span></span></span></span></span>，可解出<strong>刚好能在保质期清空的最低折扣价</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>Q</mi><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>RSL</mtext></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^* = p_0 \\left(\\frac{Q}{v_0 \\cdot \\text{RSL}}\\right)^{1/\\epsilon}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9331em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6779em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RSL</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7279em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 就是&quot;再低就亏，再高就卖不完&quot;的临界价。真实系统不会用这个理想公式直接下单，而是把它作为<strong>折扣下界</strong>——低于它宁可走清货商，高于它尽量守住毛利。欧洲多家商超（如 Ahold Delhaize、Tesco）与临期定价 SaaS（如 Wasteless 的 AI 动态折扣引擎）在 2020 年代后期部署了这套逻辑，把折扣从&quot;店员贴黄标&quot;变成&quot;系统在正确时点推送正确折扣&quot;。关键约束是<strong>价格弹性必须按品类、门店、季节分别拟合</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>定价方式</th>\n<th>决策主体</th>\n<th>响应速度</th>\n<th>适合场景</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定阶梯降价</td>\n<td>规则引擎</td>\n<td>天</td>\n<td>标品、门店执行力弱</td>\n<td>畅销品过早打折</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人工判断</td>\n<td>门店/品类</td>\n<td>小时</td>\n<td>高价值、低频品类</td>\n<td>不一致、依赖经验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态降价</td>\n<td>算法 + 规则兜底</td>\n<td>小时/实时</td>\n<td>生鲜、高频高损耗品类</td>\n<td>数据不足时误定价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>动态定价的落地门槛不在算法而在数据：<strong>缺货率、损耗率、单品级去化速率</strong>必须有历史可回算，否则模型只能退回固定阶梯。因此多数跨境卖家的可行路径是&quot;<strong>固定阶梯起步，用积累的损耗数据收敛到动态</strong>&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"清库渠道选择与去化路径决策\">清库渠道选择与去化路径决策</h2><p>跨境场景里可选渠道比线下零售更多，但每条渠道的<strong>接收门槛</strong>不同。核心约束仍是<a href=\"remaining-shelf-life-metric-threshold\">渠道最小到货剩余保质期（MRSL）</a>——同一批货对商超不合格，对折扣渠道可能合格。决策依据是一个排序：<strong>按预计单位净回收额从高到低排序，取第一个满足其 MRSL 与批量约束的渠道</strong>。</p>\n<p>最容易被忽略的是<strong>批量门槛与包装约束</strong>。清货商通常要求&quot;整板/整箱、不拆零、单 SKU 起订量&quot;，而门店临期专区恰恰是拆零销售。常见误区是系统算出&quot;折扣渠道回收率最高&quot;，运营却做不成，因为货已被拆散到只剩 3 件，批发渠道都不接。因此<strong>清库决策必须在批次仍完整时做出</strong>，一旦拆零就丧失了打包议价能力。</p>\n<p>跨境转移是一条容易被低估的路径：<strong>保质期要求存在地区差异</strong>，一批在欧盟已不能进商超的食品，在效期门槛更宽松的市场可能仍可正常销售——前提是满足目的地进口的标签、检疫与效期法规。但它合规成本高（重新报关、标签本地化、冷链续接），且<strong>清库是救火，源头效期管理才是防火</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"捐赠-销毁与合规处置\">捐赠、销毁与合规处置</h2><p>捐赠看起来&quot;零回收&quot;，但在有税收抵免与 ESG 披露需求的市场上，其<strong>综合现值可能高于低价清货</strong>。美国的食品捐赠受《Bill Emerson Good Samaritan Food Donation Act》保护，对善意捐赠者的责任有法定限制，配合 IRC 170(e)(3) 的强化扣除，企业捐赠合格食品可获得超出成本基础的税抵。法国《Loi Garot》则更强制：一定规模以上的食品零售商必须与慈善机构签订捐赠协议，不得故意使可食用食品变质——这把捐赠从&quot;可选&quot;变成了&quot;合规义务&quot;。合规链条的关键要求是<strong>可追溯与温度链证明</strong>，这正是<a href=\"../lot-expiry-data-model/lot-batch-code-expiry-attribute-model\">批次/批号编码与效期属性建模</a>能力要支撑的下游用途。</p>\n<p>销毁是最后一步，且<strong>不能是简单的&quot;扔掉&quot;</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>食品：多数司法辖区要求报废食品与可食用食品<strong>物理隔离</strong>，防止回流，部分要求记录报废量与原因。</li>\n<li>药品：中国《药品经营质量管理规范》（GSP，国家药监局）要求不合格品存入<strong>不合格品库（区）</strong>，有明确标识与专人管理；销毁需质量负责人审批、双人监督、记录留存；含麻醉/精神药品的销毁受更严格法定程序约束。</li>\n<li>电子/危险废弃物：电池、含制冷剂的冷链设备报废受《巴塞尔公约》及各地危废法规管辖，跨境运输需专门许可。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[判定为不可销售/已过期] --&gt; B[移入不合格品隔离区&lt;br/&gt;物理隔离 + 系统冻结标记]&#10;  B --&gt; C{品类合规分类}&#10;  C -- 普通食品 --&gt; D[记录报废量与原因&lt;br/&gt;可捐赠则转捐赠流程]&#10;  C -- 药品/化妆品 --&gt; E[质量负责人审批&lt;br/&gt;双人监督销毁 + 全程记录]&#10;  C -- 危废/电池 --&gt; F[委托有资质机构&lt;br/&gt;危废联单 + 跨境许可]&#10;  D --&gt; G[系统核销库存&lt;br/&gt;写报废交易流水]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[账务减记 + 损耗复盘]\">flowchart TD\n  A[判定为不可销售/已过期] --&gt; B[移入不合格品隔离区&lt;br/&gt;物理隔离 + 系统冻结标记]\n  B --&gt; C{品类合规分类}\n  C -- 普通食品 --&gt; D[记录报废量与原因&lt;br/&gt;可捐赠则转捐赠流程]\n  C -- 药品/化妆品 --&gt; E[质量负责人审批&lt;br/&gt;双人监督销毁 + 全程记录]\n  C -- 危废/电池 --&gt; F[委托有资质机构&lt;br/&gt;危废联单 + 跨境许可]\n  D --&gt; G[系统核销库存&lt;br/&gt;写报废交易流水]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[账务减记 + 损耗复盘]</pre><p>把处置做成流程而非&quot;随手处理&quot;，是因为这里同时压着<strong>合规风险</strong>（不合格品回流、回收料被二次销售）与<strong>账务风险</strong>（报废未核销导致库存虚高、盘点差异）。可审计的处置动作必须落到三处：<strong>库存系统</strong>（数量核销）、<strong>处置记录</strong>（谁在何时以何方式处理了多少）、<strong>账务凭证</strong>（减记金额与科目）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"损耗计提-报废核销与账务口径\">损耗计提、报废核销与账务口径</h2><p>近效期处置最终要在财务报表上留下痕迹，而&quot;什么时候认损&quot;直接决定利润表的平滑度。国际财务报告准则（IFRS）下，存货按<strong>成本与可变现净值（NRV）孰低</strong>计量（IAS 2）。当一批货进入近效期、预计售价已低于成本，就要<strong>计提跌价准备</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>跌价准备</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>−</mo><mtext>NRV</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>NRV</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>预计售价</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>至销售完成还需发生的成本</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{跌价准备} = \\max(0,\\ c \\cdot Q - \\text{NRV}), \\qquad \\text{NRV} = \\text{预计售价} - \\text{至销售完成还需发生的成本}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">跌价准备</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NRV</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NRV</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">预计售价</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">至销售完成还需发生的成本</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这意味着<strong>财务确认损耗通常早于实物报废</strong>：货还在架上，账上已经减记。工程系统必须把这条链路打通——当预警引擎把批次降入&quot;临期&quot;档、清库预测给出低于成本的回收价时，就应触发跌价计提候选，而非等到实物扔进垃圾桶才记账。检测链路已在<a href=\"remaining-shelf-life-metric-threshold\">剩余保质期度量与预警阈值模型</a>的 RSL 度量里埋好，财务侧只需消费同一份 RSL 数据。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时点</th>\n<th>会计动作</th>\n<th>系统事件</th>\n<th>常见错误</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>进入近效期</td>\n<td>评估 NRV，可能计提跌价</td>\n<td>预警降到临期档</td>\n<td>只在月末盘点才发现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>决定清库</td>\n<td>更新 NRV 至清库价</td>\n<td>清库渠道决策记录</td>\n<td>用原价估算 NRV</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实际售出</td>\n<td>转销跌价准备</td>\n<td>销售交易 + 批次核销</td>\n<td>跌价未转销，重复减记</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>报废</td>\n<td>核销存货 + 确认损失</td>\n<td>报废交易流水</td>\n<td>报废未入账，库存虚高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>期末</td>\n<td>存货盘点与减值测试</td>\n<td>盘点差异处理</td>\n<td>差异挂账不追责</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>跨境的额外复杂性来自<strong>多币种与多主体</strong>：一批在新加坡仓的临期货若由香港主体持有、在马来西亚报废，则跌价计提的记账本位币、报废的税务影响、跨境处置成本分散在不同主体账上。稳妥做法是<strong>把&quot;经济效期事件&quot;与&quot;法律账务事件&quot;解耦</strong>：库存系统只记录 RSL 变化与处置动作，账务系统按各主体规则翻译成凭证，两者通过批次 ID 关联。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>临期处置是<strong>随时间衰减的收益最大化</strong>：先算清&quot;现在卖&quot;与&quot;拖到报废&quot;的期望回款差，再决定降价时点与幅度。</li>\n<li><strong>折扣时机比折扣幅度更值钱</strong>，过早降价牺牲原价销量；动态降价求解的是&quot;刚好能在保质期内清空的最低折扣价&quot; <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>渠道选择按<strong>净回收率排序</strong>，受 MRSL、批量门槛、拆零约束限制；清库决策必须在批次完整时做出。</li>\n<li><strong>捐赠有真实现值</strong>（美国 Good Samaritan Act + 税抵、法国 Loi Garot 强制），但需要可追溯与温度链证明。</li>\n<li>销毁必须<strong>隔离、审批、留痕</strong>（GSP 不合格品库、危废联单）。</li>\n<li>按 IAS 2，<strong>财务认损早于实物报废</strong>：进入近效期即评估 NRV 并可能计提跌价，售出时转销、报废时核销，全程绑定批次 ID。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把这条链走通，需要预警（本文上游）、追溯（召回章节）与账务共享同一个批次维度——这正是<a href=\"../lot-expiry-data-model/lot-batch-code-expiry-attribute-model\">批次/批号编码与效期属性建模</a>要解决的根问题：为什么批次效期数据模型必须从第一天就建对。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"近效期降价促销、清库策略与过期报废处置","id":"近效期降价促销-清库策略与过期报废处置"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"阶梯降价与动态折扣定价","id":"阶梯降价与动态折扣定价"},{"level":2,"text":"清库渠道选择与去化路径决策","id":"清库渠道选择与去化路径决策"},{"level":2,"text":"捐赠、销毁与合规处置","id":"捐赠-销毁与合规处置"},{"level":2,"text":"损耗计提、报废核销与账务口径","id":"损耗计提-报废核销与账务口径"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"效期预警引擎、分级升级与处置工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/lot-batch-expiry-fefo-traceability-management/shelf-life-monitoring-alert/expiry-alert-engine-escalation-workflow"},"next":{"title":"批次全链路追溯模型（上游到下游 + 一物一码/追溯码）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/lot-batch-expiry-fefo-traceability-management/recall-traceability-compliance/batch-traceability-upstream-downstream"}}